{
    "title": "Badminton Hero-Championship",
    "description": "\"Badminton Hero-Championship\" is a competitive game that realistically simulates badminton matches. In the game, you can adjust your position by moving left and right, use skills such as smashing or volleying to defeat your opponent and win the match. Players need to flexibly apply skills and strategies to find and exploit the weaknesses of their opponents' positions. Accurate shots and quick response will be the key to winning the match.\r\n\r\nThe playing court in the game is lifelike, with detailed graphics and realistic sound effects that make you feel like you are in a real match. You can choose the single-player mode to challenge opponents of different levels, or the championship mode to compete with other experts.\r\n\r\nShow your badminton skills, improve your strength, and become a superstar on the badmi",
